  "definitions": "<defs xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><marker id=\"arrow\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L9,4 L0,8 Z\" fill=\"#263348\" /></marker></defs>\n",
  "extras": "<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"834.0\" y=\"37\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"834.0\" dy=\"0\">Sparse GCN layer  |  Module overview</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"834.0\" y=\"65\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"834.0\" dy=\"0\">module only / reviewed fixed source / independent operands  /  read bottom to top</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"289.0\" y=\"694\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f8d4e1\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"312.0\" y=\"707\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"312.0\" dy=\"0\">Inputs</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"474.0\" y=\"694\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#c8ebfb\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"497.0\" y=\"707\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"497.0\" dy=\"0\">Propagation</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"659.0\" y=\"694\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#dfdff8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"682.0\" y=\"707\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"682.0\" dy=\"0\">Parameters</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"844.0\" y=\"694\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff6bd\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"867.0\" y=\"707\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"867.0\" dy=\"0\">Add / norm</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"1029.0\" y=\"694\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#cdeaf8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"1052.0\" y=\"707\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"1052.0\" dy=\"0\">Tensor ops</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"1214.0\" y=\"694\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#c9f1cd\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"1237.0\" y=\"707\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"1237.0\" dy=\"0\">Gates</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"659.0\" y=\"724\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f3f5f7\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"682.0\" y=\"737\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"682.0\" dy=\"0\">Topology</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"844.0\" y=\"724\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#dfdff8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"867.0\" y=\"737\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"867.0\" dy=\"0\">Output</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"834.0\" y=\"765\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"834.0\" dy=\"0\">Read bottom to top; all module internals follow the same direction.</tspan>\n<tspan x=\"834.0\" dy=\"16.52\">Same operator color does not imply shared weights; instance/parameter identities are preserved in IR.</tspan>\n<tspan x=\"834.0\" dy=\"16.52\">Solid edges carry values; dashed edges carry topology, shape or loop state. Library kernels stay opaque.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"834.0\" y=\"839\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"834.0\" dy=\"0\">Reviewed static source + selected profile. Repeated groups are templates; shapes are not runtime observations.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"834.0\" y=\"869\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"834.0\" dy=\"0\">E### = source span; dashed = side / shape dependencies; fork/join roles are typed in IR; no implicit sum.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"834.0\" y=\"894\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"834.0\" dy=\"0\">Repeated colors encode operation roles. Shared weights and independent instances are recorded in semantic_ir.json.</tspan>\n</text>\n",
